Then query for the issues:

```graphql
query {
  issues(filter: {
    team: { key: { eq: "WEB" } },
    assignee: { id: { eq: "<userId>" } },
    priority: { eq: 2 },  # high priority = 2
    ...
  }) {
    nodes {
      id
      identifier
      title
      priority
      workflowState { name }
    }
  }
}
```

In Linear, priority: 0 = none, 1 = low, 2 = high, 3 = urgent.

